###
# 中文：在 IDEA 中打开本文件，替换 username/password 后，点击请求行左侧的绿色运行图标。
# 每次成功注册后都要换一个 username；数据库唯一约束会拒绝重复用户名。
# English: Open this file in IDEA, replace username/password, then click the green
# run icon beside the request. Change username after each successful registration.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = change-me-before-running
@password = change-me-before-running

### Register a user: expected HTTP 201 and code OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-register-001

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "email": "change-me-before-running@example.com",
  "displayName": "Change me before running"
}

### Re-run only after the first request succeeds: expected HTTP 409 duplicate username
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Trace-Id: af-manual-register-duplicate-001

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "displayName": "Xavier"
}
